# Copy this file to .env.local, which git ignores, and fill it in.

# A MapKit JS token, from the Apple Developer account: Certificates,
# Identifiers & Profiles, then Services, then MapKit JS. It is read when the
# site is built. Left empty, the app runs without Apple Maps and draws its
# sketch map.
#
# A deployed token is public, because the browser has to send it. Give that
# one a domain restriction. A test token has none and lasts about a week.
MAPKIT_TOKEN=
